A third live mismatch was found by diffing every field the driver initialises
against struct cfg80211_ops parsed from the v6.18 header: .set_wds_peer is gone
too (removed with the same wave of cfg80211 cleanups), and it sat unguarded at
line 7270. It is dropped and its function marked __maybe_unused.

After these five hunks the check is clean: of the driver's 45 ACTIVE initialisers
(the ones outside #if 0 blocks -- set_channel/set_beacon/add_beacon/del_beacon/
{get,set}_mesh_params all live inside #if 0), every one exists in the 6.18
struct. That is the whole cfg80211_ops surface for this driver, not a sample.
